<title>SPAIN: Aznar says Spain committed to EMU criteria, dates.</title>
<headline>Aznar says Spain committed to EMU criteria, dates.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish Prime Minister Jose Maria Aznar said on Wednesday Spain would remain committed to the integration process toward Europe's economic and monetary union.</p>
<p>&quot;I want to ratify, especially at this time, the government's wish to contribute to the construction of Europe without putting in doubt the criteria, calendar or results obtained after such laborious negotiations,&quot; Aznar said in his opening speech in a debate on the state of the nation.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 2161</p>
